ind":"update","title":"Demo Update - v0.0.16-b5","summary":"FIXESFixed an issue causing The Alpha's ring attack to become invisible (again)Fixed small warningsAdjusted The Alpha's outline width","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-22T07:00:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199312225","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3575040-1835871199305603","game_id":"steam-3575040","kind":"update","title":"Update - v0.0.16-b4","summary":"FEATURESAdded a custom cursor and a toggle option in the settingsAdded the new achievement \"Destroyer\"QOLDisabled locking onto environment objects while enemies are presentFIXESFixed an input issue in the Power Core Energy selection menuRemoved joystick controls in UI menus to prevent unintended selection changesFixed consecutive shop encounter (Hope so)Fixed an issue causing The Alpha's ring attack to become invisibleFixed excessive vignette effects on ultrawide screensOPTIMIZATIONAdjusted post","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-18T22:17:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199305603","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3575040-1835236783575425","game_id":"steam-3575040","kind":"announcement","title":"Life Core Demo Is Now Live!","summary":"We’re excited to announce that the Life Core Demo is now available!In the demo, you’ll begin your journey toward Gartos, the first planet featured in the full game and face our first major enemy, The Alpha.Wield your sword, our first playable melee weapon, discover powerful upgrades, grow stronger and do your best to survive the final encounter.As you play, please keep in mind that many systems are still in development and do not yet represent their final versions. After trying the demo, don’t f","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-16T19:52:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783575425","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3575040-1835236783574051","game_id":"steam-3575040","kind":"update","title":"Update - v0.0.16-b3","summary":"QOLAdjusted enemy spawn vfx colorsDisabled the cursor while using a gamepadDisabled Gadget Power Core spawn where no Gadget is equippedFIXESFixed several sfx triggersFixed gamepad vibration triggers","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-16T12:09:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783574051","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3575040-1835236783565710","game_id":"steam-3575040","kind":"update","title":"Update - v0.0.16-b2","summary":"BALANCE CHANGESAdjusted Gamma laser lenght, damage and rotation speedAdjusted The Alpha spawn section countDecreased Thunder Dash damage and removed its stagger effectAdjusted Spark Energy drop ratesAdjusted secret achievement requirementsMajor enemy spawn data set changesAdjusted some of The Alpha's attack animation speedsAdjusted The Alpha attack selection logicAdjusted Power Core spawn chanceAdjusted Dash cooldownQOLDisabled camera fov change on DashAdjusted sfx volumesFIXESFixed an input err","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-13T11:35:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783565710","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3575040-1835236783560150","game_id":"steam-3575040","kind":"update","title":"Update - v0.0.16-b1","summary":"FEATURESAdded mouse input for settings slidersAdded ready indicators for OverchargeAdded a bunch of new sfxAdded new music tracksBALANCE CHANGESDecreased Gamma laser, damage and rotation speedDecreased Kappa healthDecreased Theta health, damage and stagger multiplierDecreased Zeta damage, stagger multiplier and projectile velocityIncreased Power Core spawn changeAdjusted enemy spawn data for an easier early gameQOLEdited target locking to prioritize enemies before destructiblesFIXESFixed generat","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-11T12:07:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783560150","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3575040-1833968530895316","game_id":"steam-3575040","kind":"announcement","title":"Store Page Updated","summary":"We've updated our Steam page.We've refreshed several sections, including descriptions, screenshots, and GIFs. Be sure to check out the latest updates.Stay tuned for more updates coming soon.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-31T12:56:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530895316","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3575040-1832700592788659","game_id":"steam-3575040","kind":"announcement","title":"Leaderboard is here","summary":"The Leaderboard system is now available in the demo.You can compete for the fastest completion times through both Global and Friends leaderboards, and compare your runs with other players.We’re also planning to expand the system with additional leaderboard categories and competitive features in future updates.(The times shown in the image are for illustrative purposes only)","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-14T10:30:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592788659","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3575040-1832065502818919","game_id":"steam-3575040","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo soon","summary":"Hello everyone,We’ve been a bit quiet for a while, but development on Life Core has been continuing steadily behind the scenes.We’re getting closer to releasing our first playable demo, and from this point forward we’ll start sharing more frequent updates about the game’s progress.For our first devlog, we wanted to share some of the recent UI improvements we’ve been working on, along with an early look at the Power Core selection screen.More updates coming soon.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-10T08:22:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502818919","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:29:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3575040":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:32Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:31Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3575040":"2026-10-26T10:39:32Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3575040":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:31Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:31Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:31Z"},"4762100":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:32Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:32Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:39:32Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3575040","app_id":3575040,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:1